b1 is a text with value "gone: the absence of a value", size 40, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.03em", lineheight "1.1"
b2 is a text with value "gone means no value exists. It is not the same as empty text, zero, an empty list, or false.", size 18, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.55"
b3 is a text with value "Gone — Absence of a Value", size 26, weight 800, foreground "#0b1d36", letterspacing "-0.02em", margin "14px 0 0 0"
b4 is a text with value "Otter uses:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b5 is a text with value "gone", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
b5label is a text with value "Output", size 12, weight 600, foreground "#4a5b75"
b5copy is a button with text "Copy", size 12, weight 600, background "#c9d6e8", foreground "#0f1f36", radius 6, padding "4px 12px"
b5head is a row with spread, align middle, width full, background "#dde6f2", padding "8px 14px", customstyle "box-sizing: border-box; border-radius: 12px 12px 0 0;"
put b5label, b5copy in b5head
b5block is a column with spacing 0, width full
put b5head, b5 in b5block
when b5copy is clicked
    copy text of b5 to clipboard
    text of b5copy is "Copied"
.
b6 is a text with value "to represent the absence of a value.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b7 is a text with value "gone is Otter's equivalent of concepts such as null, nil, or None in other programming languages.", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
