b22 is a text with value "They mean:", size 16, foreground "#3a4d6b", lineheight "1.6"
b23 is a text with value "gone       no value exists\n\"\"         a string exists but contains no characters\n0          a number exists and is zero\nempty      a collection exists but contains no items\nfalse      a boolean exists and is false", size 14, foreground "#0f1f36", background "#e8eef7", radius 12, fontfamily "'JetBrains Mono', Consolas, monospace", whitespace "pre", customstyle "padding: 16px 22px; line-height: 1.7; overflow-x: auto; border-top-left-radius: 0; border-top-right-radius: 0;"
